#: ../../entities/abb.rst:1
msgid "ABB open innovation / Shanghai robotics"
msgstr "ABB开放创新／上海机器人生态"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:4
msgid "ABB开放创新／上海机器人生态"
msgstr "ABB开放创新／上海机器人生态"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:6
msgid "Corporate program | Pudong | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "企业创新计划｜浦东新区｜研究核对日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Hardware AI, Robotics."
msgstr "人工智能与产业方向：硬件人工智能、机器人。"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:10
msgid ""
"ABB publishes open-innovation and startup collaboration routes. Its May "
"2025 Shanghai AI event is evidence of ecosystem activity, not an "
"always-open startup accelerator cohort. Propose a measurable robotics use "
"case."
msgstr "ABB公布开放创新及初创企业合作路径。2025年5月上海人工智能活动证明生态活动存在，不代表长期开放的加速营。可提交可量化的机器人应用方案。"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S036 "
"<https://www.abb.com/global/en/company/innovation/open-innovation>`_. "
"Open innovation | ABB."
msgstr "`证据 S036 <https://www.abb.com/global/en/company/innovation/open-innovation>`_. Open innovation | ABB."

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "状态与支持"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构有来源，招募待确认"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:19
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "本条未核实统一现金资助、免费权益或股权比例，请索取现行书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系与位置"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:24
msgid ""
"`Official website / intake route "
"<https://www.abb.com/global/en/company/innovation/open-innovation>`_"
msgstr "`官网／对接入口 <https://www.abb.com/global/en/company/innovation/open-innovation>`_"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:26
msgid ""
"A direct program phone or email is not verified here. Use the official "
"route and request the responsible team; no contact has been invented."
msgstr "本版未核实项目直线电话或邮箱。请通过官方渠道索取负责团队，本图谱不编造联系人。"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:28
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图位置使用区级或校区锚点，并非核实后的办公室位置。"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:30
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:33
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:35
msgid "Identify the corporate business owner and one measurable use case."
msgstr "确认企业业务负责人及可量化场景。"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit the product brief, pilot evidence and relevant technical "
"requirements."
msgstr "提交产品简介、试点证据及相关技术要求。"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:39
msgid ""
"Confirm cohort availability or agree a scoped pilot, data rights and IP "
"terms."
msgstr "确认招募情况或约定试点范围、数据权利与知识产权。"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:41
msgid ""
"Review procurement, payment, acceptance and the production decision "
"separately."
msgstr "分别审核采购、付款、验收及转生产决策。"

#: ../../entities/abb.rst:43
msgid ":doc:`Pudong district route </districts/pudong>`"
msgstr ":doc:`浦东新区对接路径 </districts/pudong>`"
